From 589fe8d403e996b55b1e111aecbe7a73dbff07a0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dmitry Dubina <dmitryd.prog@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 11:08:22 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] overview: Add focus-ring and shadow overrides

Lets the overview use its own focus ring and window shadow, e.g. a thicker
ring so the focused window is visible at zoomed-out scale. Overrides apply
on top of the layout settings, and window rules still apply on top.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
